                                "sense_id": "32e73307-3b07-38c1-a75c-7643d25fcd21",
                                "text": "Here and there are beds of oolites, for example, made of little rounded grains – like millet seed – that form only in agitated warm waters, such as you might find off the Bahamas today."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
